@page "/components/message"

<PageTitle>Message — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Message</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    The wider shape around a <a href="/components/bubble">Bubble</a>, with room for an avatar, a
    header and a footer. An <code>&lt;article&gt;</code> rather than a div: a thread is a list of
    separately authored things, and that is what lets a screen reader move between them instead of
    reading the whole thing as one wall.
</p>

